    "updated_at": "2015-10-20T07:57:04Z",
    "body": "> I was thinking just special rules for `display` in the top layer thingie.\n\nOK, I was worried that this might be a performance issue if there wasn't any/much existing stuff like this, but it looks like there's already some style adjustment for top layer in Blink, so it shouldn't be a problem.\n",
