    "created_at": "2015-10-20T18:47:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-20T18:47:42Z",
    "body": "> I don't think we should ever force display value of fullscreen element to a single value, because fullscreen element can be a container, and thus, unlike backdrop, different display values are useful for fullscreen element.\n\nRight, setting it to `block` or whatever _at all times_ is def wrong; it'll break things all over the place.  It's just a decent default for what to do when you have to force it to generate a box.\n",
