    "body": "I think it's fine to compute `contents` to `block` if the element is in the top layer.\n\nI tend to respect the original value and the rule in the CSS spec (thus the proposal in comment 0), but if that adds much more complexity to this spec, I don't think it's worth.\n\nIn respect of implementation, both are fine.\n",
